{
  "id": "S1E20",
  "season": 1,
  "episode": 20,
  "showTitle": "The Hard Saying",
  "title": "Stay",
  "dates": "Sunday, December 6 – Friday, December 11, 2009",
  "logline": "Twelve and oh in overtime, a rainstorm indoors and out, a holy day on three hours’ sleep, a song with a name in it — and a door somebody has never opened for anyone.",
  "previously": [
    {
      "text": "Up the coast at one in the morning she asked you to LA. “I want to. I work Saturday. I’m not calling in.” “Next time I’ll ask somewhere worse.”",
      "if": "e19_la==\"candor\""
    },
    {
      "text": "Up the coast at one in the morning she asked you to LA. “I don’t own a TV. I’m not going to a party for one.”",
      "if": "e19_la==\"wit\""
    },
    {
      "text": "Up the coast at one in the morning she asked you to LA. “Ask me again. Somewhere I can’t say no.” “Careful, Jack.”",
      "if": "e19_la==\"sincerity\""
    },
    {
      "text": "Up the coast at one in the morning she asked you to a party in LA. You work Saturdays.",
      "if": "e19_la!=\"candor\" && e19_la!=\"wit\" && e19_la!=\"sincerity\""
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Marine Lab turnout, with your door open and the cold coming in: “I don’t take people home.” “Why?” “I’ve never wanted to yet.”",
      "if": "skye_no_home"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a drugstore aisle at half past one in the morning: “Where do you go, Jack?” “The library. Work. Around.”",
      "if": "lena_asked_where && e19_where==\"control\""
    },
    {
      "text": "In a drugstore aisle at half past one in the morning: “Where do you go, Jack?” “Confession. I have a lot of material.”",
      "if": "lena_asked_where && e19_where==\"wit\""
    },
    {
      "text": "In a drugstore aisle at half past one in the morning: “Where do you go, Jack?” “I’ll tell you sometime. Not yet.” “Okay.”",
      "if": "lena_asked_where && e19_where==\"candor\""
    },
    {
      "text": "In a drugstore aisle at half past one in the morning: “Where do you go, Jack?” You asked where she goes. Bastille on Thursdays. The nine o’clock.",
      "if": "lena_asked_where && e19_where==\"restraint\""
    },
    {
      "text": "In a drugstore aisle at half past one in the morning, she asked where you go.",
      "if": "lena_asked_where && e19_where!=\"control\" && e19_where!=\"wit\" && e19_where!=\"candor\" && e19_where!=\"restraint\""
    },
    {
      "text": "In the laundry room at half past four, she stepped back first. “Don’t make me be the one who wrecks something, Jack. You know I won’t.”",
      "if": "lena_asked_where"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Julian’s writing something. He won’t let me hear it till it’s done.”",
      "if": "julian_writing_song"
    },
    {
      "text": "In daylight, on the back of her car: “I’m starting in January. Here. Spring. Undeclared.”",
      "if": "knows_skye_spring"
    }
  ],
